#  weather monitoring system records temperature and humidity over five days. The 
temperature values are [22, 25, 28, 30, 32], and the humidity values are [80, 75, 68, 60, 55]. 
Write a Python program to calculate the covariance matrix of temperature and humidity, and 
to visualize their relationship with a scatter plot. 



import numpy as np
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

T = [22,25,28,30,32]
H = [80,75,68,60,55]
print(np.cov([T,H]))
plt.scatter(T,H)
plt.show()
